 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Nice. How about two sessions? One casual day where everyone gets to chat in the kitchen, and one structured game night so people have something to do? Then go for a day you know will be warm, like mid to late August. Announce a few months ahead so people have time to plan. Not necessarily. Some people just like to turn up with what they have. But if few people don't cook, something can happen. That's a great start. And maybe ask each person to bring one dish they' excited share. Let people know months ahead so they can plan. Some families even book a hall for the night so nobody's room is busy.",
